{
  "chapter_id": "CH009",
  "title": "Laws You Gave Yourself",
  "sections": [
    {
      "section_id": "SEC036",
      "title": "When Admiration Becomes Law",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Spiritual experience is not general; it is always individual, always personal. What God does in one life does not become a universal standard that everyone else must now match.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA139",
            "SRC003736",
            "SRC003737",
            "SRC003738"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003736",
            "SRC003737",
            "SRC003738"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA139"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000001",
          "provider_handle": "p1"
        },
        {
          "text": "I recognize how easily this truth gets lost. I look at my pastor, Mama Sabine, and I see her resilience, her consistency. I see the way she dances, the way she talks. An image forms in my head, and I desire that. But I know that I cannot be like that, exactly as she is. So, without realizing it, I begin to create laws in my head. She did not create the law. I create the law, and that law begins to constrain me.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA140",
            "EX022",
            "SRC003740",
            "SRC003741",
            "SRC003742",
            "SRC003743",
            "SRC003744",
            "SRC003745",
            "SRC003749",
            "SRC003752",
            "SRC003753",
            "SRC003755",
            "SRC003757",
            "SRC003761",
            "SRC003762"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003740",
            "SRC003741",
            "SRC003742",
            "SRC003743",
            "SRC003744",
            "SRC003745",
            "SRC003749",
            "SRC003752",
            "SRC003753",
            "SRC003755",
            "SRC003757",
            "SRC003761",
            "SRC003762"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA140"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX022"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000002",
          "provider_handle": "p2"
        },
        {
          "text": "But show me one condition God gave. Where do you get the law that you have to be like Bishop Chris in order to be known by God? God never laid down such a demand; it is self-imposed.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA141",
            "SRC003814",
            "SRC003821",
            "SRC003822",
            "SRC003823"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003814",
            "SRC003821",
            "SRC003822",
            "SRC003823"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA141"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000003",
          "provider_handle": "p3"
        },
        {
          "text": "When you compare yourself to another person's spiritual attainment, wanting to 'be like' a famous minister or a figure you admire, there are things underneath that comparison. First, you despise yourself. Second, you think God doesn't know you. Third, you think you can impress God by becoming someone else.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA142",
            "SRC003828",
            "SRC003829",
            "SRC003830"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003828",
            "SRC003829",
            "SRC003830"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA142"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000004",
          "provider_handle": "p4"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA139",
        "IDEA140",
        "IDEA141",
        "IDEA142"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC003736",
        "SRC003737",
        "SRC003738",
        "SRC003740",
        "SRC003741",
        "SRC003742",
        "SRC003743",
        "SRC003744",
        "SRC003745",
        "SRC003749",
        "SRC003752",
        "SRC003753",
        "SRC003755",
        "SRC003757",
        "SRC003761",
        "SRC003762",
        "SRC003814",
        "SRC003821",
        "SRC003822",
        "SRC003823",
        "SRC003828",
        "SRC003829",
        "SRC003830"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC037",
      "title": "He Knows How He Made You",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "You are unique. You are the fruit of this unique person that you are, made deliberately and placed deliberately. He made you and dropped you exactly where you are. Do you think he is stupid? Do you think he made you and put you there so that a Japanese man is better than you?",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA143",
            "SRC003845",
            "SRC003856",
            "SRC003857",
            "SRC004123",
            "SRC004125",
            "SRC004127"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003845",
            "SRC003856",
            "SRC003857",
            "SRC004123",
            "SRC004125",
            "SRC004127"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA143"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000005",
          "provider_handle": "p5"
        },
        {
          "text": "He knows you as a person. He can create a law that would break you, but he cannot do it, because he knows you. He would be right just to do that, yet he does not, because of who you are to him.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA144",
            "SRC003874",
            "SRC003875",
            "SRC003876",
            "SRC003879"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003874",
            "SRC003875",
            "SRC003876",
            "SRC003879"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA144"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000006",
          "provider_handle": "p6"
        },
        {
          "text": "He knows the village you came from. He knows that your parents, that the road, that the politicians, that even 2026, are all part of what he knows about you. So he disposes himself accordingly, and you can function like that, like Jesus functioned, despite your particular origin and hardship.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA145",
            "SRC003884",
            "SRC003886",
            "SRC003888",
            "SRC003891",
            "SRC003893",
            "SRC003896",
            "SRC003898"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC003884",
            "SRC003886",
            "SRC003888",
            "SRC003891",
            "SRC003893",
            "SRC003896",
            "SRC003898"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA145"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000007",
          "provider_handle": "p7"
        },
        {
          "text": "By the grace of God, I prayed. I fasted for years. God helped me, and I broke through. These testimonies of breakthrough are not instant achievements; they are the fruit of a long process.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA151",
            "SRC004069",
            "SRC004073",
            "SRC004075",
            "SRC004077",
            "SRC004079"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004069",
            "SRC004073",
            "SRC004075",
            "SRC004077",
            "SRC004079",
            "SRC004089",
            "SRC004091",
            "SRC004092"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA151"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000008",
          "provider_handle": "p8"
        },
        {
          "text": "This is not a hundred-meter dash. No. It's a marathon. You have to run this race all your life.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA151",
            "SRC004089",
            "SRC004091",
            "SRC004092"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004089",
            "SRC004091",
            "SRC004092",
            "SRC004069",
            "SRC004073",
            "SRC004075",
            "SRC004077",
            "SRC004079"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA151"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        },
        {
          "text": "You are talking as though this God is one that, to reach him, you have to be this powerful, this extreme. Many believers overestimate the difficulty of drawing near to God, imagining him as a distant, demanding figure who requires extraordinary feats before he will receive them.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA152",
            "SRC004108",
            "SRC004110",
            "SRC004111"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC004108",
            "SRC004110",
            "SRC004111"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA152"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000010",
          "provider_handle": "p10"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA143",
        "IDEA144",
        "IDEA145",
        "IDEA151",
        "IDEA152"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
